    "Hydraulic excavator is one of the most commonly used construction equipments. In addition, thedemand of large excavator has been increased. PTO gearbox, installed between engine and pumps, is usedto improve fuel efficiency of large excavator. Because the PTO gearbox is loaded by the pump mountedon the output shaft, the torque distribution technique should be applied when controlling the load with thedynamometer. This paper introduces a torque distribution technique and conducts a comparative analysis ofthe torque test results and dynamic analysis.": 1
